      "width": 250,
      "height": 150,
      "position": {
        "x": 1150,
        "y": 870
      },
      "text": "Aggregation because chess\\npieces are not part of the board,\\ncan exist independently, but\\n board keeps track of it's pieces \\n(Multiplicity: if each player has 16 \\npieces)",
